v1.3.10 (2026-05-28)
--------------------
Fix: SecureNAT status still showed Stopped for hubs using vpncmd fallback path.

- vpncmd GetHubStatus handler now parses the "SecureNAT" field from StatusGet
  output and populates SecureNATEnabled_bool correctly (key confirmed from
  SoftEther source code — Command.c PsStatusGet, value is "Enabled"/"Disabled")
- Only emitted for standalone hubs; cluster member hubs correctly show no
  SecureNAT (SoftEther does not include the field for them)
